<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuador is enforcing a fourth curfew through Nov. 10 in five coastal provinces as violence escalates, and the military has begun its first land operation against cartels with U.S. assistance, including U.S. Marines seizing a vessel linked to the Los Choneros gang in the eastern Pacific. Heavy rain on Santa Cruz Island in the Galapagos killed a priest when a crucifix fell on him, prompting an archbishop to announce a clergy safety plan. President Daniel Noboa continues to detain opposition leader Luisa González on money-laundering charges. The crisis recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNWk8xbVpKVVo3aDJVZjZSa2pBOXB3SnNmam5iYlltcC01aWh2Z01oNEZRNmxMcTlsbkhZV2hMc1h0NzFiLXQyNWlxNTZIZDYxQ01sYTF2TTB5X0lsMGRIVVR1Ym9SODVaOXZQc1VGeXBPYk1GaUU5NDUzMVNERWkwa0JTX1haSmMyQWFN?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Breitbart News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Beliefnet&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE44M3ZNM2R4anJvMEswM2RsMlNxeFdLbkZaTVBrNTU2X1dPbEJqWk9ZUGc2eXdnRVRBWEhYSzdFbVZpSVhxMjlkQXpHbjBQLXE5UnpJZlMzUVIyM1RxMllZ0gFcQVVfeXFMUDJuTmJ6R1lpd1V3aHgwYThJYjVyVWNZNzNneG83ZFhCdTlaM3hhdHZWWXl6RGZpLVhsSW1qTVRmd2FDTkY4c2RoczliTTZGQVEyY1JMdEt3cnZqQ1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxOZUQ5dlFOcEN3MjdPWlVkS2ZISWk3WDM2MzVYeldYaGJkWWY3YkVLOWRBdHc4UzBlOWVJZ1hpNHhVRllPVkRyajhBbkVxai0tV21VaGh0UnoxNFBTTkE2cjU2eEI2TF9aR2d5MW9IU3hlcUJ0WGZUT3dGU2VoXzBydTNoVUJlTEdVcUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tempo.co English&l